Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bc5ff6a3-8ae5-3747-97fd-b55bcbb22926.xml</text>
